    # entries.rpy:4
    old "Zack was born in Brookdale on March 11th, 2009. He joined the police academy as soon as he finished high school, and graduated from there with top honors. He is now one of the most famous detectives in the East Coast of the United States. He enjoys spending most of his time watching movies, with dreams of eventually writing his own."
    new "扎克于 2009 年 3 月 11 日出生在布鲁克代尔。高中一毕业他就考入警官学校，并以最优成绩从那里毕业。如今他是美国东海岸最著名的侦探之一。他大部分时间都花在看电影上，梦想有朝一日能自己写一部。"

    # entries.rpy:6
    old "Green bitch!"
    new "绿毛婊子！"

    # entries.rpy:6
    old "Natasha Flores"
    new "娜塔莎·弗洛雷斯"

    # entries.rpy:6
    old "Natasha was born in Monterrey, Mexico on February 27th, 2012. Due to her parents’ divorce, she ended up moving to Brookdale with her father at a very young age. She holds no bitter feelings to her mother and will visit her pretty often. Natasha is a very popular streamer that specializes in JRPGs and loves cosplaying anime characters. Her favorite anime of all time is 86. She has an older brother and a younger sister who moved to Brookdale recently, though they don’t live together. Natasha dreams of making her own video game, which led her to pursuing a degree in Game Design at Brookdale U."
    new "娜塔莎于 2012 年 2 月 27 日出生在墨西哥蒙特雷。由于父母离婚，她很小就跟着父亲搬到了布鲁克代尔。她对母亲毫无怨气，还经常去看她。娜塔莎是一位人气极高的主播，专精 JRPG，也很喜欢扮演动漫角色。她最喜欢的动画是《86》。她还有一个哥哥和一个妹妹，最近也搬到了布鲁克代尔，不过他们并不住在一起。娜塔莎梦想着做出一款属于自己的电子游戏，也因此前往布鲁克代尔大学攻读游戏设计专业。"

    # entries.rpy:8
    old "A mysterious girl that helped Zack and Natasha make their way to Eden. She seems to be highly secretive of her past. However, she does not seem to have ill intentions. Members of the Church speak highly of her. She has a free spirit and hates the feeling of being confined. However, she finds a lot of peace within order."
    new "一位神秘少女，帮助扎克和娜塔莎来到伊甸。她对自己的过去守口如瓶。不过看起来她并无恶意。教会中的人对她评价很高。她崇尚自由，厌恶被束缚的感觉。但她却在秩序之中找到了莫大的安宁。"

    # entries.rpy:10
    old "Gianna Ambrossi"
    new "吉安娜·安布罗西"

    # entries.rpy:10
    old "Gianna was born in New York on November 17th, 2003. Daughter of a widowed father, Gianna spent most of her early life attached to her father and grew extremely fond of him as she matured. When her father remarried, Gianna not only paid for the entire wedding, but also the honeymoon. She is a world renowned singer and actress, she is mostly known for her role in 007 Velvet Strike. Admittedly, she hates that role. Gianna also has a master in Psychology, with her ultimately wanting to become a therapist for children."
    new "吉安娜于 2003 年 11 月 17 日出生在纽约。父亲是鳏夫，因此吉安娜的童年大多依偎在父亲身边，随着年岁渐长也愈发敬重他。父亲再婚时，吉安娜不仅包下了整场婚礼，连蜜月旅行也一并买单。她是享誉世界的歌手兼演员，最为人知的是在《007 丝绒Strike》里的表演——不过说实话，她很讨厌那个角色。吉安娜还拥有心理学硕士学位，最终目标是成为儿童治疗师。"

    # entries.rpy:12
    old "With an unknown birthdate, all that is known about her birth is that she is the sole surviving member of the Samakuze Clan, which was wiped out 20 years ago. Found by a warlord, Yuki was trained in the arts of assassination from a very young age. Her kill count being in the thousands, she has become desensitized to killing… or has she?"
    new "她的出生日期无人知晓，出生时的唯一记录是：她是二十年前被灭门的佐间氏族唯一的幸存者。由纪被一位军阀收养，从很小起便被训练成刺客。杀人数以千计，她早已对死亡麻木……还是说，并没有？"

    # entries.rpy:12
    old "Yuki of the Samakuze Clan"
    new "佐间氏族的由纪"

    # entries.rpy:12
    old "Zack… wait no, white!"
    new "扎克……等等，不对，是白色！"

    # entries.rpy:17
    old "A man living in the fabled End of Times. Only a select few know about his existence, and even less people know about his origins. Tasked with guiding travellers to the correct timeline, he leads a peaceful life of contemplation."
    new "一位生活在传说中「时间尽头」的男人。只有极少数人知道他的存在，知晓他来历的更是寥寥无几。他的职责是把旅行者引向正确的时间线，过着平静而冥想的生活。"

    # entries.rpy:17
    old "The Guru of Time"
    new "时间导师"

