    old "The Almighty Richard"
    new "全能的理查德"

    # entries.rpy:19
    old "The Guardian of War. The Almighty Richard is a creature that transcends the universe. Multiple gods have come to him for help in order to keep peace in their realms. He resides in the End of Times alongside the Guru of Time, who often visits him to give him headpats and scratches."
    new "战争守护者。全能的理查德是超越宇宙的存在。为维持自己神域的和平，不止一位神祇前来向他求助。他与时间导师一同住在时间尽头，而时间导师常常来看他，摸摸他的头、挠挠他的痒。"

    # entries.rpy:21
    old "35 (allegedly)"
    new "35 岁（据说）"

    # entries.rpy:21
    old "She is the head of the Church of Luminox. Not much is known about her past. A victim of the war in Ryosei, she came to the Church for shelter, ultimately becoming a priestess and rising through the ranks thanks to her generosity and compassion. She has a soft spot for Ravena."
    new "她是露米诺克斯教会的领袖。她的过去鲜为人知。作为凉星战争的受害者，她来到教会寻求庇护，最终成为女祭司，并凭借自身的慷慨与悲悯一步步晋升。她对拉维娜格外偏爱。"

    # entries.rpy:23
    old "Mara’s right hand gal, she is the most promising priestess in the Church of Luminox right now. Selena spends most of her time assisting Mara with whatever it is she may need. She enjoys spending her free time in the Cathedral’s garden, where she has helped with planting the vast majority of the flowers there. Rumors have it that her duties go as far as attending Bishop Mara at night."
    new "玛拉的左膀右臂，也是当下露米诺克斯教会里最有前途的女祭司。塞莱娜把大部分时间都花在协助玛拉处理各种事务上。空闲时她喜欢待在主教座堂的花园里，那儿绝大部分的花都是她帮忙种下的。有传闻说，她的职责还包括在夜间侍奉玛拉主教。"

    # entries.rpy:23
    old "Sister Selena"
    new "塞莱娜修女"

    # entries.rpy:25
    old "Fire, Nature, Water, and Wind"
    new "火、自然、水与风"

    # entries.rpy:25
    old "Milena of Meliode"
    new "梅利奥德的米莱娜"

    # entries.rpy:25
    old "The middle child of the Meliode princesses, Milena (aka Millie) is Ravena’s childhood best friend. Unlike Ravena, however, she has a very mild temperament and would much rather spend her time studying than going on little adventures with her best friend. Due to her high intelligence, she has mastered all four of the basic elements, making her a formidable opponent. It is said that to this day, she is the only person to beat Ravena in a private duel the two held."
    new "梅利奥德公主中的老幺，米莱娜（昵称米莉）是拉维娜儿时最好的朋友。然而与拉维娜不同，她性情温和得多，宁可把时间花在学习上，也不愿和好友四处冒险。凭借极高的智商，她掌握了四种基础元素，成为不可小觑的对手。据说至今为止，她仍是唯一一位在与拉维娜的私下对练中赢过她的人。"

    # entries.rpy:27
    old "Clara is the eldest daughter of a family of adventurers. She spends most of her time going on quests protecting small villages neighboring the capital of the kingdom. After that, she will go to a bar and try to seduce other women. Unfortunately for her, women fear her and only men want her. Truly one of the most tragic stories of Eden."
    new "克拉拉是一个冒险者家族的长女。她大部分时间都在执行任务，保护王都周边的小村庄。之后她就会跑去酒吧，试图勾引别的女人。可惜女人们都怕她，只有男人才想要她。真是伊甸最悲剧的故事之一。"

    # entries.rpy:27
    old "Clara, Ravena’s Friend"
    new "克拉拉，拉维娜的朋友"

    # entries.rpy:29
    old "Lucia, Genius Scientist"
    new "露西娅，天才科学家"

    # entries.rpy:29
    old "When talking about the brightest minds of Eden, one simply cannot have that conversation without Lucia. Lucia was part of the crew that went on an adventure to save Eden alongside Ravena’s parents. Naturally, she sees Ravena as a niece. Uninterested in love, she spends all of her time rebuilding robots, hoping to guarantee the existence of a friend long gone…"
    new "谈起伊甸最聪慧的那批头脑，没人能绕开露西娅。当年她与拉维娜的父母一同参与了拯救伊甸的冒险，自然而然把拉维娜当成侄女看待。她对恋爱毫无兴趣，把所有时间都花在重造机器人上，只盼着能让一位早已故去的朋友永远存在下去……"

    # entries.rpy:31
    old "A few months"
    new "几个月"

    # entries.rpy:31
    old "Lucia’s most recent creation: a robot with cat-like qualities. People wonder what is going on inside her head. The answer? Nyah! This loveable goofball has ultimately become Lucia’s assistant and mascot of her store. She is especially popular with ladies."
    new "露西娅最新期的作品：一台有着猫咪特质的机器人。人们都好奇她脑子里在想什么。答案？喵！这位可爱的傻乎乎姑娘最终成了露西娅的助手兼店铺吉祥物，在女士群体中尤其受欢迎。"

    # entries.rpy:31
    old "MIAU, Creation of Lucia"
    new "MIAU，露西娅的作品"

    # entries.rpy:33
    old "Tobias is one of the most purehearted people you will ever meet. Sure, he might scam you out of 15 gold, but were you not entertained? He adores telling stories and making those around him happy. Unfortunately for him, that often comes at the price of his freedom."
    new "托拜厄斯是你能遇上的最纯粹的人之一。当然，他可能会骗走你 15 个金币，但你不也看够了乐子吗？他热衷于讲故事、取乐身边的人。只可惜对他来说，这份快乐常常要用他的自由来交换。"

    # entries.rpy:33
    old "Tobias the Traveller"
    new "旅行家托拜厄斯"

    # entries.rpy:35
    old "A mysterious “oracle” that set up shop in the fair. Despite seeming harmless, a dark aura emanates from her. Not much information is available about this person. Caution recommended."
    new "一位在集市上摆摊的神秘「神谕者」。虽然看似人畜无害，她身上却散发着黑暗的气息。关于此人的情报少之又少。谨慎为上。"

    # entries.rpy:35
    old "Lady at the Fair"
    new "集市上的女士"

    # entries.rpy:37
    old "Arguably the most powerful Dark Caster of all time (comparing her to Vela would be the Jordan vs Lebron conversation of Eden), but you wouldn’t be able to tell from a first glance. Her mother-like nature makes people instinctively trust her, something she proves is the right decision over and over again. She also has the highest sex drive out of the five witches, but that is something she controls very well… sorta."
    new "她大概是有史以来最强的暗系施法者（拿她和薇拉比，就像拿乔丹比勒布朗）。但你第一眼绝看不出来。她那近乎母亲的性情让人本能地信任她，而她也一次又一次证明这份信任是对的。她的性欲还是五位魔女中最强的，不过她控制得很好……大概吧。"

    # entries.rpy:37
    old "Sophia, Witch of Darkness"
    new "索菲娅，暗之魔女"

