    old "[ REDACTED ]"
    new "[ 已屏蔽 ]"

    # entries.rpy:39
    old "The Chancellor"
    new "宰相"

    # entries.rpy:39
    old "The Chancellor has served the royal family ever since he learned how to control his powers. His ability to control the minds of others made him indispensable to the royal family… until Ravena’s parents started to question whether he was forcing people to confess. The Chancellor started to resent the King and Queen because of that, ultimately leading to his plot against the royal family."
    new "宰相从学会控制自己力量的那天起，就一直为王室效力。他操控他人心智的能力令他对王室不可或缺……直到拉维娜的父母开始怀疑，他是不是在逼迫他人吐露心声。宰相因此开始怨恨国王与王后，最终策划了对王室的阴谋。"

    # entries.rpy:41
    old "Arguably the best lawyer in Temporia, Gris also spends a lot of her free time working as a public servant of the kingdom. She also used most of the money she’s earned as a lawyer to build orphanages or dining halls where the poor could eat. It is rumored that the King and Queen were about to name her as the next chancellor of Eden."
    new "葛莉斯大概是坦皮奥拉最好的律师，同时她也花大量时间担任王国的公职。她把当律师赚来的大部分钱都用来建孤儿院和供穷人吃饭的食堂。有传言称，国王与王后差点就指定她为伊甸的下一任宰相。"

    # entries.rpy:41
    old "Gris, Protector of Truth"
    new "葛莉斯，真理的守护者"

    # entries.rpy:43
    old "The Bishop in charge of overseeing the Church of Luminox in the capital. Many people adore Jane. That group of people does not include Bishop Mara. Mara is looking for a way to demote her and promote Selena as the next Bishop of the capital, but the red tape within the order holds her back. She is seen as incompetent by her peers and easily pushed over by the Chancellor."
    new "负责监管王都露米诺克斯教会的主教。许多人很爱戴简，而这群人里不包括玛拉主教。玛拉正想找办法把她降职，提拔塞莱娜出任王都下一任主教，但教内繁文缛节拖住了她。在同僚眼中她能力不足，在宰相面前也轻易被压下去。"

    # entries.rpy:47
    old "Despite her young age, she is one of the wisest rulers in the Kingdom of Temporia. Had she been found by the royal family, she would be in contention for the position of chancellor alongside Gris. Neira is very raw at her Nature Casting, so she never misses out on an opportunity to get help from other Nature Casters that come around. She has been in charge of Lunebrook for the past 6 years and has really helped improve the city."
    new "尽管年纪轻轻，她已是坦皮奥拉王国最睿智的统治者之一。若是她被王室发现，如今恐怕正与葛莉斯一同争抢宰相之位。奈拉在自然系施法上还很生涩，所以从不错过任何向路过自然系施法者求助的机会。她掌管卢恩布鲁克已有 6 年，真正把这座城市带好了。"

    # entries.rpy:47
    old "Neira, Mayor of Lunebrook"
    new "奈拉，卢恩布鲁克市长"

    # entries.rpy:49
    old "20 (allegedly)"
    new "20 岁（据说）"

    # entries.rpy:49
    old "A woman that has lost herself to lust and self-pleasure. She is constantly sacrificing furniture in order to become a succubus and reach more fulfilling orgasms. Genuinely harmless, she just wants a man to fuck her hard and fuck her good. She is also Neira’s best friend."
    new "一个彻底沉溺于欲望与自慰的女人。她不断牺牲家具，只为变成魅魔、迎向更尽兴的高潮。她本人确实无害，只想有个男人狠狠地、痛快地操她。她还是奈拉最好的朋友。"

    # entries.rpy:49
    old "Lily, Succubus?"
    new "莉莉，魅魔？"

    # entries.rpy:51
    old "After giving up her status as a Celestiarch, Ailana went on to live her life in a cave near Lunebrook. She often wanders around the forest and watches over the city peacefully. Despite not having contact with anyone in centuries, she will spend most of her time viewing the memories she shared with the Wayfarer, which is enough to keep her happy."
    new "放弃天枢之位后，艾拉娜便在卢恩布鲁克附近的山洞里生活。她常在森林中游走，静静地守护着这座城市。虽已数百年未与人接触，她却把大部分时间都花在重温与游荡者共同的记忆上，那便足以让她快乐。"

    # entries.rpy:51
    old "Ailana, Fallen Celestiarch"
    new "艾拉娜，堕落的天枢"

    # entries.rpy:51
    old "Unknown, born near the beginning of time"
    new "不详，诞生于时间之初"

    # entries.rpy:53
    old "Aqua, Witch of Water"
    new "阿库娅，水之魔女"

    # entries.rpy:53
    old "Believe it or not, Aqua is the 2nd oldest member of the Circle of Eden. Her lack of seriousness made her the most approachable of the Five Witches, but also the target of the harassment of some vile people. She would always find a way in her heart to forgive those that wronged her. Do not underestimate this woman, what she lacks in size, she makes up for it with incredibly precise and quick attacks. "
    new "信不信由你，阿库娅是伊甸之环中第二年长的成员。她不苟言笑的态度让她成为五位魔女中最平易近人的一个，却也让她成了某些卑鄙之徒的骚扰目标。她总能找到一个理由，在心底原谅那些伤害过她的人。千万别小看这个女人——身材不足的部分，她会用精准又迅猛的攻击补回来。"

    # entries.rpy:53
    old "Older than Sophia"
    new "比索菲娅还年长"

    # entries.rpy:53
    old "Water and Dark"
    new "水与暗"

    # entries.rpy:55
    old "Queen Sahar of Thallum"
    new "萨勒姆的萨哈尔女王"

    # entries.rpy:55
    old "The Divine Ruler of Thallum. Queen Sahar is one of the closest friends and allies to the King and Queen of Temporia. She rules her people mercifully, but justly as well. She has also been revolutionary in the rights for femboys within her kingdom. Despite having many suitors from different kingdoms, Sahar has not entertained any of these suitors. "
    new "萨勒姆的神圣统治者。萨哈尔女王是坦皮奥拉国王与王后最亲近的朋友和盟友之一。她仁慈地统治着她的人民，同时也公正无私。她还在王国内女性权益上推动了变革。尽管来自各国的求婚者络绎不绝，萨哈尔却从未认真考虑过其中任何一位。"

    # entries.rpy:57
    old "The Moonborn are the elite force of Thallum. Tasked with protecting Queen Sahar, they have consecrated their lives to Cealith, the Celestiarch of Wind, and become exponentially more powerful. It is said that 100 Moonborn could take down an army of 10,000 soldiers."
    new "他们将一生奉献给风之天枢凯莉丝，实力因此成倍暴涨。"

    # entries.rpy:59
    old "Another Outlander, Cinnie is also from Earth! She was proclaimed an Oracle despite her constantly saying she was not one. People believed in her even more as an Oracle since her advice actually solved multiple issues with common sense. Eventually, she formed a strong bond to Eden and is one of the only people in history to have met Luminox. This helped her discover a spell to look eternally young; however, Cinnie still decided to dress up like her OC from Earth.  "
    new "辛西同样是外来者，也来自地球！尽管她反复强调自己并非神谕者，人们还是推举了她为神谕者。而她的建议往往真凭常识就解决了若干问题，于是人们愈发信服。最终她与伊甸建立了深厚的羁绊，也是历史上仅有的见过露米诺克斯的人之一。这段经历让她发现了永驻年轻的法术；不过辛西还是决定继续穿成她在地球上的 OC。"

    # entries.rpy:59
    old "Cinnie the Oracle"
    new "神谕者辛西"

    # entries.rpy:66
    old "A city in the East Coast of the United States, a few hours south of New York. It is, for the most part, a tranquil city where most people walk due to the small size of the city and fantastic public transportation. Multiple rich people live in Brookdale due to the low taxation and good social policies. Brookdale is also home to a fantastic public university where any graduate is practically guaranteed to succeed in life."
    new "美国东海岸的一座城市，在纽约以南数小时车程内。这里大体上是一座宁静的小城，城区不大加上公共交通出色，大部分人都靠步行。因为低税收和良好的社会政策，不少富人在布鲁克代尔安家。布鲁克代尔还拥有一所出色的公立大学，任何毕业生几乎都注定会在这段人生中有所成就。"

    # entries.rpy:67
    old "A bar owned by the Warren siblings, this is one of Brookdale’s oldest bars, dating almost 150 years! This place is often visited by college students due to the owners wanting it to be a place where young folk can hang out. This is due to the fact that the bar was able to become what it is thanks to it being a college bar when Brookdale U was founded."
    new "这间酒吧由华伦兄妹经营，是布鲁克代尔最老的酒吧之一，将近 150 年历史！大学生常来光顾，因为店主希望这里能成为年轻人聚会玩乐的地方。这要归功于布鲁克代尔大学创立时，它就是一家学院酒吧。"

    # entries.rpy:67
    old "Oak N Ivy"
    new "橡树与长春花"

    # entries.rpy:70
    old "A place outside of time. Travellers often find themselves here when they travel in groups of 4 or more. The Guru of Time and Almighty Richard live here. It is also believed that this place is a direct link to Luminox’s realm, and that the Guru of Time and Richard spend most of their time in her realm instead of in the End."
    new "一个位于时间之外的地方。旅行者结伴四人以上时，常会误入此地。时间导师与全能的理查德都住在这里。据说此地与露米诺克斯的神域直接相连，而时间导师和理查德大半时间都待在神域里，而非时间尽头。"

    # entries.rpy:70
    old "The End Of Times"
    new "时间尽头"

    # entries.rpy:71
    old "A Cathedral built around the Time Warp in Eden. This is the heartbeat of the Church of Luminox, as well as where most of the priestesses reside. Any young lady that wants to become a priestess comes to complete her training in the Cathedral. There are rumors that the Cathedral holds many secrets and passages that have not been explored, but these conspiracies are often dismissed by common folk and attribute the accusations to lunacy."
    new "一座围绕伊甸的时间扭曲点建起的主教座堂。这里是露米诺克斯教会的心脏，也是多数女祭司的居所。任何想成为女祭司的年轻女子都会来这里完成训练。虽有传闻说座堂里藏着许多未被发现的秘密与密道，但这些阴谋论往往被百姓当作疯话。"

    # entries.rpy:72
    old "A house that is a few hours away from the capital. This location is known to few. Ravena spends most of her time here. She will only leave the house if she is asked to fulfill her duties as Princess of Temporia. This house is built on a hill with a nearby lake. Sunsets here are beautiful. This house is suspiciously close to the territory of the Witch of Darkness."
    new "一座离王都几小时路程的房子，位置鲜为人知。拉维娜大部分时间都待在这里，只有在需要履行坦皮奥拉公主的职责时才会离开。房子建在山坡上，附近还有一片湖。这里的日落美极了。而这座房子，恰好离暗之魔女的领地近得可疑。"

    # entries.rpy:72
    old "Ravena's House"
    new "拉维娜的家"

    # entries.rpy:73
    old "Duskveil Thalos"
    new "暮纱塔洛斯"

    # entries.rpy:73
    old "This forest is believed to be haunted due to the absurdly painful headache different casters get. This is a barrier cast by the Witch of Darkness in order to ward unwanted visitors from her land."
    new "据说这片森林闹鬼，因为不同属性的施法者走进去都会头疼得难以忍受。这是暗之魔女布下的结界，用来把不受欢迎的访客挡在她的领地之外。"

    # entries.rpy:74
    old "A very eery looking house that could easily appear in a horror movie. The inside of Sophia’s house is simply a facade to the Time Pocket in which she dwells."
    new "一座看起来鬼气森森、仿佛随时会出现在恐怖片里的房子。索菲娅家的内部，不过是通往她所居住的时间口袋的一层门面。"

    # entries.rpy:74
    old "Sophia’s House"
    new "索菲娅的家"

    # entries.rpy:75
    old "Temporia Castle"
    new "坦皮奥拉城堡"

    # entries.rpy:75
    old "The pride and joy of Temporia Kingdom. This castle has been standing for centuries and was designed to handle any sort of siege. It is impenetrable. The prison within the castle was built due to an incident that happened with the Queen of Temporia a few centuries ago."
    new "坦皮奥拉王国的骄傲与荣光。这座城堡矗立了数百年，设计上足以应对任何形式的围攻。它坚不可摧。城堡内的监狱，是几百年前坦皮奥拉王后发生的一桩变故之后修建的。"

    # entries.rpy:76
    old "If Eden had rankings of the ugliest places to visit, this place would top the list by a mile. Despite the low life expectancy, residents of Lunebrook don’t run out because they don’t have anything else to do in this town except for having sex"
    new "要是伊甸有最难看的地点排行榜，这里绝对遥遥领先。尽管居民预期寿命极短，卢恩布鲁克的人却不会离开，因为在这座城里除了做爱，他们也没别的事可干。"

    # entries.rpy:77
    old "A jungle in which Aqua, the Witch of Water, resides. People that go into this dungeon are often never seen again. Everyone would much rather take a 3-day detour to reach Thallum from Temporia, or vice-versa."
    new "水之魔女阿库娅栖居的丛林。走进这座地宫的人往往再也无人得见。所有人都宁愿绕路三天也要去萨勒姆或坦皮奥拉，谁都不想踏进这里。"

    # entries.rpy:77
    old "The Everchanging Jungle"
    new "无常之森"

    # entries.rpy:78
    old "Thallum’s most popular restaurant. Newcomers often believe this is a brothel due to people leaving extremely sweaty, but that is simply due to the fact that internal temperature is very high. Thallum’s ventilation systems need serious help. Natasha describes this place as Femboy Hooters."
    new "萨勒姆最受欢迎的餐厅。新来的人常因为顾客出来后一身大汗而以为这是妓院，其实纯粹是因为店内温度太高。萨勒姆的通风系统亟需改进。娜塔莎把这里形容为「娘炮版霍顿」。"

    # entries.rpy:78
    old "The Prancing Pony"
    new "跳跳马酒馆"

    # entries.rpy:79
    old "Ancient ruins linked to the Celestiarch of Light. Ancient texts claim that these ruins hold the entrance to the Lake Beyond Time, which is the realm of the Celestiarch of Light."
    new "与光之天枢相关的远古遗迹。古籍称这片遗迹中藏着通往「时间彼岸之湖」的入口，而那里正是光之天枢的领域。"

    # entries.rpy:79
    old "The Ruins of Light"
    new "光明遗迹"

    # entries.rpy:81
    old "Kingdoms of Eden"
    new "伊甸诸国"

    # entries.rpy:82
    old "The Kingdom of Temporia"
    new "坦皮奥拉王国"

    # entries.rpy:82
    old "The most powerful kingdom in Eden. They have the most territory out of all the nations and have been blessed with competent rulers throughout their history. Having spent most of their recent time in peace, they have been able to invest in the arts and science, leading them into a Golden Age of peace and prosperity."
    new "伊甸最强大的王国，疆域在诸国中最大，历代君主也都英明。近来大部分时间都在和平中度过，因此得以大力投入艺术与科学，走进了和平繁荣的黄金时代。"

    # entries.rpy:83
    old "A small, insignificant kingdom on an island. The weather is dreadful and it is often used as a prison. The rulers keep the money other nations send in order for them to keep their prisoners. It is a lawless land and often ignored by major political parties."
    new "一座海上的小国，微不足道，天气恶劣，常被当作监狱使用。统治者保留各国送来的钱，只为帮忙关押囚犯。这里无法无天，大国政治势力往往对它视而不见。"

    # entries.rpy:84
    old "A matriarchy in the desert. Thallum is often seen as the most powerful ally of Temporia. In recent times, Queen Sahar and King Temporia XXXIV have formed an incredibly powerful alliance. Thallum is a matriarchal nation where men and women’s traditional roles are flipped. This has led to a whole new set of social problems that Queen Sahar has been dealing with internally."
    new "沙漠中的母系王国。萨勒姆常被视为坦皮奥拉最强大的盟友。近来萨哈尔女王与坦皮奥拉第三十四世国王结成了极为强大的同盟。萨勒姆是个母系国家，男女的传统角色完全颠倒，由此衍生出一整套新的社会问题，萨哈尔女王一直在国内逐一应对。"

    # entries.rpy:84
    old "Divine Queendom of Thallum"
    new "萨勒姆神圣女王国"

    # entries.rpy:85
    old "A new nation born from the ashes of war. The Ryosei clans are famously known for continuously waging war against each other. This all changed when Queen Hinata united them under her clan, leading to a short, but needed era of stability and peace. The clan leaders look up to Hinata and are more than happy to let her lead them."
    new "从战争灰烬中诞生的新国家。凉星诸氏族素来以彼此混战闻名，直到日向女王将它们统一到自己麾下，才带来了短暂却必要的稳定与和平。各氏族首领敬仰日向，也乐于由她来统领。"

    # entries.rpy:85
    old "United Clans of Ryosei"
    new "凉星氏族联盟"

    # entries.rpy:86
    old "The cradle of elves. This village is hidden from many, and only few can confirm its existence. Elven-kind have spread far and wide to the region, but many still remain. Only female elves exist, meaning the number of elves in the world has dwindled quite a bit."
    new "精灵的摇篮。这座村庄隐于世外，许多人都不知道它的存在，能证实的人寥寥无几。精灵一族虽已散布到各地，却仍有很多留存。世上只剩女性精灵，这意味着精灵的总数已经锐减不少。"

    # entries.rpy:86
    old "Village of Meliode"
    new "梅利奥德村"

    # entries.rpy:89
    old "An ability created by Vela which is gifted to all Dark Casters that have followed her. These places are outside of time, making them valuable retreats for Dark Casters to spend their time in."
    new "薇拉创造的能力，被赐予所有追随她的暗系施法者。这些地方位于时间之外，因此成了暗系施法者极为宝贵的休憩之所。"

    # entries.rpy:89
    old "Time Pockets"
    new "时间口袋"

    # entries.rpy:90
    old "Spiritual Energy"
    new "灵力"

    # entries.rpy:90
    old "The life source of all living beings. Spiritual Energy is what allows for people to use magic spells and grow more powerful."
    new "一切生灵的生命之源。正是灵力让人能够施展法术，并不断变强。"

    # entries.rpy:91
    old "The Creator. Religion is based around her. She is a Goddess that is widely loved in the world and deeply revered.nnLuminox's Commandmentsnn- Truth shall prevail.nn- Preserve all that is from Luminox.nn- Honor the past, strive for the future."
    new "造物主。一切宗教皆源于对她的信仰。她是一位深受全世界爱戴与敬畏的女神。nn露米诺克斯的戒律nn- 真理当胜。nn- 守护一切出自露米诺克斯之物。nn- 敬怀过去，奋进未来。"

    # entries.rpy:92
    old "“The Descendants of Vela”, witches in Eden form a contract with Vela to grow in power. This power can be used to conquer, but most witches prefer using it to protect. They tend to live in silence, devoting their life to research."
    new "「薇拉的后裔」，伊甸的魔女与薇拉缔结契约以获取力量。这份力量可以用来征服，但多数魔女更愿用它来守护。她们往往默默生活，将一生奉献给研究。"

    # entries.rpy:93
    old "A Divinarch and matriarch of Witches. She is one of the first recorded cases of a person ascending and becoming a Divinarch. She was part of a brutal conflict in the Eastern Continent which left said continent barren and uninhabitable."
    new "天枢，魔女族的族长。她是最早被记载的升格为天枢的人之一。她曾参与东大陆的一场残酷冲突，那场战争让整块大陆变得贫瘠、不宜居住。"

    # entries.rpy:94
    old "The weakest dragon in Eden. This dragon was so weak that it was somehow tamed by humans. If dragons could speak, Velorion would be the butt of every joke they made. Truly a disappointment for dragon-kind."
    new "伊甸最弱的龙。这条龙弱得离谱，居然被人类驯服了。倘若龙会说话，维洛里安必定是它们所有笑话的笑柄。真是龙族的耻辱。"

    # entries.rpy:95
    old "Spiritual Awakenings"
    new "灵力觉醒"

    # entries.rpy:95
    old "When a person reaches their full potential, they go through a process called “Spiritual Awakening”. Often triggered by intense emotion, these awakenings tend to be the person breaking from the world and getting as close as humanly possible to Luminox."
    new "当一个人达到潜力的极限时，便会经历一个被称为「灵力觉醒」的过程。觉醒往往由强烈的情绪触发，它意味着那个人挣脱了世界的束缚，尽可能贴近人所能抵达的极限——露米诺克斯。"

    # entries.rpy:96
    old "The Children of Luminox. There are six Celestiarchs, each representing one of the Spiritual Energies. They came to existence when Luminox created the world and were tasked with blessing people with their Spiritual Energy."
    new "露米诺克斯的子嗣。共有六位天枢，各自代表一种灵力。他们在露米诺克斯创造世界时随之诞生，并肩负着用自己的灵力赐福人类的使命。"

    # entries.rpy:97
    old "Humans that ascended to godhood. There are few known cases of this, but plenty of Divinarchs in the heavens. Divinarchs are allowed to interact with the world, but are very limited with how much they can do. More often than not, they do not want to trifle with human affairs and would rather continue their eternal life with Luminox."
    new "升格为神的人类。此类案例寥寥无几，但天穹之上却有不少天枢。天枢被允许与世界互动，但能做的事非常有限。更多时候，他们并不愿插手人类事务，宁可与露米诺克斯一同永生。"

    # entries.rpy:98
    old "Rulers of the Underworld. Nexians are very cunning beings and are not to be taken lightly. They can offer great power, in return for something equally valuable. Utmost caution must be taken when dealing with Nexians."
    new "冥界的统治者。涅克西安族极其狡猾，绝不可轻视。他们能赐予强大的力量，作为回报则索取同等珍贵的东西。与涅克西安族打交道时务必万分谨慎。"

